---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Where to Eat Near Lake View Park"
  description="Where to eat near Lake View Park Islamabad: on-site stalls, Murree Road options and how to verify before you rely on a specific place."
  path="/nearby-food/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'Is there food inside Lake View Park?', a: 'CDA’s destination page describes local food stalls and tea shops within and around the park, but which vendors are open and their menus and prices change day to day — confirm on the day.' },
    { q: 'Where else can I eat?', a: 'The Murree Road corridor and central Islamabad have more established restaurants. Search current listings and reviews, and check hours before you go.' },
    { q: 'Should I bring my own food?', a: 'A picnic is the most reliable option — the open lawns suit it and you control the food. It also avoids depending on a vendor being open.' },
    { q: 'Why no specific restaurant list?', a: 'Any specific name, address or price here would be unverified and could mislead. Confirm any venue through current listings before travelling.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Where to eat nearby', href: '/nearby-food/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Picnic guide', href: '/picnic-guide/' },
    { label: 'Visitor facilities', href: '/visitor-facilities/' },
    { label: 'Nearby attractions', href: '/nearby-attractions/' },
    { label: 'From central Islamabad', href: '/from-islamabad-city/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">Eating near Lake View Park ranges from on-site snacks to the restaurants along Murree Road and central Islamabad. This page avoids listing unverified specific restaurants.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Inside and around the park</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">CDA’s destination page describes local food stalls and tea shops within and around the park. Which vendors are open, and their menus and prices, change day to day — confirm on the day rather than relying on a particular stall.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Murree Road and the city</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">For a fuller meal, the Murree Road corridor and central Islamabad have more established restaurants. Search current listings and reviews, and check opening hours before you go.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Bring your own</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">A picnic is a reliable option — open lawns suit it, and you control the food (see the <a class="font-semibold text-[#a66f2d] underline" href="/picnic-guide/">picnic guide</a>). It also avoids depending on a vendor being open.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-[#b3261e] bg-[#fdecea] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#b3261e]">No invented restaurant list</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#7a1c16]">Confirm any venue’s existence, location and hours through current listings before travelling.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Eat flexibly</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Because on-site vendors and city restaurants both vary, the safe move is to plan for a picnic and treat any stall or restaurant as a bonus. Confirm whatever you choose through current listings rather than a fixed recommendation.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist title="Eating nearby checklist" items={[
      'Expect on-site stalls to vary day to day — confirm on arrival.',
      'For a meal, check current Murree Road / city listings.',
      'Bring a picnic if you want a reliable option.',
      'Don’t rely on a specific vendor being open.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg" width="1280" height="960" alt="Calm Rawal Lake view from Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={2} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
